@startuml
title 4.2 Shipping Fee at Checkout - sequence diagram
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBorderColor #444444
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

actor Customer as U
participant "View" as V <<View>> #EADCFF
participant AccountController as AC <<Controller>> #D8F3DC
participant AccountService as AS <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant OrderController as C <<Controller>> #D8F3DC
participant OrderService as S <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant ShopRepository as SR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant AddressRepository as AR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant GhnService as GHN <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant "GHN API" as API <<External>> #FFE0E0

== A. Load the saved addresses ==
U -> V : open /checkout?item=...
V -> AC : GET /api/account/addresses
AC -> AS : list(userId)
AS -> AR : findByUserIdAndShopIsNullOrderByCreatedDateAscIdAsc(userId)
AR --> AS : List<Address>
AS --> AC : List<AddressResponse>
AC --> V : 200 OK
V -> V : select the default address (else the first one)
note right of V
  No saved address: a link to /account to add one and the order button stays disabled.
  The recipient name and phone follow the selected address (still editable).
end note

== B. Estimate the fee (once per shop, in parallel) ==
V -> V : group the ticked items by shop
loop each shop in the order
  V -> C : GET /api/orders/{userId}/shipping-fee?shopId=...&addressId=...
  C -> C : requireOwner(userId, currentUser)
  C -> S : estimateShippingFee(userId, shopId, addressId)
  S -> SR : findById(shopId)
  SR --> S : Shop (else 404)
  S -> AR : findById(addressId)
  AR --> S : Address
  S -> S : address belongs to the user, else 400 choose a saved address
  S -> S : address has ghnDistrictId and ghnWardCode, else 400
  S -> AR : findByShopIdAndUserIsNullOrderByCreatedDateAscIdAsc(shopId)
  AR --> S : pickup addresses of the shop
  S -> S : pick the default one, else the first\n(none, or no GHN codes: 400 shop has no pickup address)
  S -> GHN : calculateFee(fromDistrict, fromWard, toDistrict, toWard, 2000 g)
  GHN -> API : POST /shiip/public-api/v2/shipping-order/fee
  alt GHN answers with a price
    API --> GHN : 200 total
    GHN --> S : fee
    S --> C : fee
    C --> V : 200 {"shippingFee": fee}
  else GHN error (HTTP, body, GHN code, no connection)
    API --> GHN : error or no answer
    GHN --> C : 502 "Lỗi từ GHN: ..." (503 when no GHN token is configured)
    C --> V : error message
    V -> V : show the message under that shop, its fee stays empty
  end
end

== C. Show the totals ==
V -> V : fee per shop, total shipping = sum of the fees
V --> U : shipping line per shop and total
note over V
  Changing the address estimates again for every shop.
  "Place order" stays disabled until every shop has a fee.
  The voucher picker also asks for the fee when a shipping voucher is selected (7.6).
end note

@enduml
